# Audited: IsEven's entry and the four lambda calls (Even 3, Odd 2, Even 1, Odd 0) are the five cycles, by D6 as ruled (a call of an unbounded lambda is a cycle point); 3 is odd, so False.
# The mutually recursive lambdas' tests: declarations of sem-ch07-lambda-cycle.prism (Semantics
# chapter 6).
emit Ui.*
use App.*

test lambdas_take_a_cycle_a_call, @Checked 3:
    build
        => expect Ui.Label(text="working")
    compute until idle
        => expect Ui.Label(text="False")
